message: >-
  Provisional research draft and reproduction software. Please verify the final
  author-approved publication metadata before citing a journal version.
type: software
title: "When Kernel Affine Hull Geometry Helps Prediction: Local Coordinates, Decoder Capacity, and Conditional Gains"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Mohit
  - family-names: Kargaran
