url: "https://github.com/MohitKumarRostock/Kernel_Affine_Hull_Koopman_Machine/tree/research/kahm-predictive-geometry/extensions/predictive_geometry"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible matched-geometry experiments investigating conditional predictive
  gains from kernel affine hull representations, local position coordinates,
  decoder capacity, and query-kernel numerical stabilization. Includes exact
  historical sources, compact outcome archives, protocol evidence, and a
  portable one-command computational reproduction pipeline. This metadata
  describes a provisional manuscript, not an accepted publication.
keywords:
  - kernel affine hull machines
  - predictive representations
  - forecasting
  - reproducibility
  - local geometry
